WEBVTT

00:09.009 --> 00:10.135
UPPER - FOUR

00:23.273 --> 00:24.649
You little girl…

01:01.519 --> 01:04.522
DEMON SLAYER: SWORDSMITH VILLAGE ARC

02:18.138 --> 02:22.934
EPISODE 10:
LOVE HASHIRA MITSURI KANROJI

02:26.938 --> 02:28.231
Hey, you!

02:28.314 --> 02:30.191
You've caused too much harm!

02:30.275 --> 02:33.236
I'll get Nezuko and Genya back from you!

02:33.319 --> 02:35.864
Shut your mouth, Bitch!

02:35.947 --> 02:40.326
Only one person in this world
can give me orders.

02:42.620 --> 02:44.622
Did he say the B word?

02:44.706 --> 02:48.918
B… Does he mean me?

02:49.002 --> 02:52.797
Unbelievable! How can he use such a word?

02:52.881 --> 02:56.092
He's about the same age
as my little brother.

02:57.468 --> 03:01.890
Wait, demons don't look like
their actual age, do they?

03:02.599 --> 03:04.893
But still, that's a horrible thing to say!

03:04.976 --> 03:05.852
HATE

03:05.935 --> 03:08.646
Crazed Cry of Thunder Death!

03:09.939 --> 03:11.149
Miss Kanroji!

03:12.191 --> 03:14.944
Love Breathing, Third Form:

03:17.697 --> 03:19.407
Catlove Shower!

03:22.118 --> 03:23.786
Now I am angry!

03:23.870 --> 03:26.706
You may look like a kid,
but I won't tolerate it!

03:26.789 --> 03:28.958
What the…

03:30.293 --> 03:34.380
This little girl neutralized my attack.

03:39.928 --> 03:42.347
How bizarre the shape of her sword is.

03:43.306 --> 03:46.309
It's too fast to follow with my eyes.

03:46.392 --> 03:48.853
Is it because
of the sword's bending ability?

03:48.937 --> 03:50.855
What tremendous flexibility!

03:50.939 --> 03:52.982
The swordsmith who made it is amazing,

03:53.066 --> 03:55.902
and Kanroji who is able to use it
is even more amazing!

04:04.911 --> 04:07.247
Love Breathing, Second Form:

04:07.830 --> 04:09.457
Love Pangs!

04:13.878 --> 04:15.380
Sixth Form:

04:16.005 --> 04:18.091
Cat-Legged Winds of Love!

04:18.841 --> 04:21.135
She can even keep up with this speed.

04:23.513 --> 04:25.515
In that case, I'll use this technique.

04:26.224 --> 04:29.435
Blood Demon Art: Countless Striking Trees!

04:32.355 --> 04:34.065
A wide-range technique!

04:42.156 --> 04:44.492
Oh no! The main body will escape!

04:45.868 --> 04:48.538
Can I handle those winds myself?

04:50.623 --> 04:53.126
Love Breathing, Fifth Form:

04:53.209 --> 04:57.171
Swaying Love, Wildclaw!

05:07.140 --> 05:08.433
Got you!

05:08.516 --> 05:10.643
She's fast! But that is bad!

05:10.727 --> 05:11.686
Kanro--

05:11.769 --> 05:12.603
HATE

05:12.687 --> 05:14.397
Is he trying to do something?

05:14.856 --> 05:17.692
But no worries,
as long as I sever his head…

05:17.775 --> 05:20.403
Miss Kanroji, that's not his main body!

05:20.486 --> 05:22.405
He won't die even if you sever the head!

05:22.488 --> 05:24.657
Huh? What? Seriously?

05:24.741 --> 05:26.909
I made the wrong call…

05:26.993 --> 05:29.037
Compressed Sound Waves!

05:33.333 --> 05:34.500
Miss Kanroji!

05:43.009 --> 05:44.677
Unbelievable!

05:46.012 --> 05:51.642
Her body is still intact even though
she was hit by my attack.

05:52.643 --> 05:57.190
Did she stiffen up every muscle in her
body just before being hit by my attack?

05:57.273 --> 06:00.902
But still, not anyone can withstand it.

06:03.905 --> 06:05.239
I can't comprehend.

06:05.323 --> 06:07.492
No, wait. I see.

06:07.575 --> 06:11.162
This little girl's strength
doesn't match her appearance.

06:12.080 --> 06:13.414
She has peculiar features.

06:14.999 --> 06:16.167
This is good.

06:16.876 --> 06:20.880
Eating quality flesh leads directly
to gaining more strength.

06:21.506 --> 06:27.011
But first, I have to crush
her skull and brain.

06:37.897 --> 06:39.065
Miss Kanroji.

06:40.399 --> 06:41.526
Miss Kanroji.

06:42.819 --> 06:43.945
Miss Kanroji.

06:46.364 --> 06:51.285
Only a bear or a boar or a bull
would marry you.

06:52.537 --> 06:57.583
Just thinking about my children having
your odd hair color gives me shivers.

06:58.835 --> 07:01.462
Let's pretend this marriage arrangement
never happened.

07:01.963 --> 07:04.257
And please forget about me.

07:04.340 --> 07:05.466
Goodbye.

07:07.760 --> 07:09.011
At the age of seventeen,

07:10.012 --> 07:13.307
my marriage arrangement was called off.

07:20.022 --> 07:22.066
I'm strong, aren't I?

07:29.031 --> 07:31.451
What are you doing
competing against a child?

07:31.534 --> 07:36.205
I didn't have muscle bulges
on my skinny arms, but…

07:36.873 --> 07:42.086
My mother would tell me
what my childhood was like repeatedly.

07:43.546 --> 07:45.965
When I was a year and two months old…

07:46.048 --> 07:50.136
When my mother was pregnant
with my little brother.

07:54.307 --> 07:55.391
Mitsuri?

07:56.184 --> 07:57.560
Where are you, Mitsuri?

07:59.645 --> 08:00.521
Mitsu…

08:03.858 --> 08:08.029
I was trying to help with the kitchen work

08:08.112 --> 08:12.241
and I lifted a stone
that weighed four kan.

08:13.993 --> 08:17.079
My mother had always been
known for being cool and calm,

08:17.163 --> 08:21.292
but that day, she was shocked
for the first time.

08:22.752 --> 08:25.129
Thank you for always helping me.

08:26.255 --> 08:27.131
SOBA RESTAURANT

08:27.215 --> 08:31.052
I have always had a big appetite
since I was a child.

08:31.761 --> 08:33.721
I love to eat.

08:35.890 --> 08:38.267
She eats a lot!

08:38.351 --> 08:41.812
Sumo wrestler,
how come you lost to a child?

08:41.896 --> 08:45.441
Even though you say that… We just can't…

08:45.525 --> 08:46.734
Here.

08:46.817 --> 08:48.986
Sakura mochis for dessert.

08:49.070 --> 08:50.655
Let's dig in!

08:52.573 --> 08:54.742
Are you really sure?

08:54.825 --> 08:56.702
Totally!

08:56.786 --> 08:59.330
You can go all out against her!

08:59.413 --> 09:02.458
Since he says so, just do it.

09:05.253 --> 09:07.547
Ready? Go!

09:11.926 --> 09:13.928
Your arms may be thin,

09:14.011 --> 09:17.390
but your muscle density must be
extraordinary compared to others.

09:20.434 --> 09:24.313
But as I got older,
little by little I realized

09:24.855 --> 09:28.484
that I was different
from other girls around my age.

09:29.527 --> 09:33.948
Mom, I wonder if I'll ever be a bride.

09:34.865 --> 09:37.034
Why are you asking that?

09:38.369 --> 09:41.330
Because I'm too strong.

09:42.039 --> 09:43.457
I eat a lot.

09:44.083 --> 09:46.127
Even my hair color is weird.

09:47.211 --> 09:50.673
You can just stay with us forever.

09:51.382 --> 09:56.429
But, women must get married
and become brides, right?

09:57.179 --> 10:00.391
You can just stay here with us forever.

10:04.020 --> 10:06.230
After my marriage arrangement
was called off,

10:06.897 --> 10:08.816
I thought I had to hide my hair color.

10:10.234 --> 10:12.278
I dyed my hair black.

10:13.279 --> 10:15.323
I held back from eating too much.

10:16.365 --> 10:18.075
I also pretended to be weak.

10:18.909 --> 10:21.370
My family was worried.

10:24.373 --> 10:28.586
Then, a man appeared
who was willing to marry me.

10:30.838 --> 10:32.006
Is this okay?

10:32.632 --> 10:34.216
Is this all right?

10:34.884 --> 10:38.220
I wonder if I can live like this
for the rest of my life.

10:39.096 --> 10:43.476
My big appetite, my strength,
and my hair color…

10:44.727 --> 10:46.312
are what make me who I truly am.

10:47.897 --> 10:49.982
Do I have to pretend to be someone else?

10:51.067 --> 10:56.614
Is there any way I can help people
when I am truly myself?

10:57.490 --> 11:01.327
Is there a place in this world
where I can just be myself?

11:02.870 --> 11:05.956
Is there someone who will love me?

11:07.583 --> 11:09.126
This is not right.

11:09.919 --> 11:10.878
Not right!

11:19.261 --> 11:22.056
Get up! Get up! Hurry!
He's going to attack again!

11:22.139 --> 11:23.808
I know!

11:24.475 --> 11:26.811
Huh? Did I pass out?

11:27.645 --> 11:29.355
Protect Miss Kanroji!

11:29.438 --> 11:32.608
She's the light of hope
that is our greatest chance!

11:33.234 --> 11:36.779
As long she's alive, we can win!

11:36.862 --> 11:38.364
Let's win this together!

11:38.447 --> 11:41.242
None of us are going to die!

11:42.868 --> 11:44.745
How ridiculous.

11:48.833 --> 11:50.042
You must be joking.

11:57.591 --> 11:59.093
Did I get them?

11:59.176 --> 12:02.221
Thank you, guys!

12:02.304 --> 12:05.724
I'm sorry I messed up,
even though I'm a Hashira!

12:05.808 --> 12:08.227
I will not let my comrades die!

12:08.561 --> 12:12.106
The Demon Slayer Corps
is an important place for me!

12:12.189 --> 12:15.192
I don't care if it's against
Upper Rank or whatever!

12:15.276 --> 12:17.820
She slashed it all! So cool!

12:18.362 --> 12:21.699
I definitely won't lose to bad guys!

12:21.782 --> 12:25.411
Be ready! I'm about to get serious!

12:26.036 --> 12:30.958
DEMON SLAYER: SWORDSMITH VILLAGE ARC

12:31.041 --> 12:35.963
DEMON SLAYER: SWORDSMITH VILLAGE ARC

12:37.465 --> 12:38.757
Impressive.

12:39.967 --> 12:44.889
You are especially beloved
by Gods, Mitsuri.

12:46.557 --> 12:48.684
Be proud of your strength.

12:50.269 --> 12:54.773
Everyone who speaks ill of you
is merely afraid

12:55.774 --> 12:57.818
and envious of your talent.

13:04.408 --> 13:06.869
Thank you so much!

13:09.580 --> 13:11.874
Mom, Dad…

13:12.750 --> 13:15.336
Thank you for giving birth to me
with a strong body.

13:16.086 --> 13:19.798
Everyone in the Demon Slayer Corps
is accepting me.

13:20.466 --> 13:23.010
Congratulations on becoming a Hashira!

13:23.093 --> 13:24.428
Congratulations!

13:25.763 --> 13:28.599
Thank you! I'll do my best!

13:28.682 --> 13:31.644
Want some sakura mochis?
I only have this much though.

13:31.727 --> 13:33.020
KAKUSHI

13:33.521 --> 13:39.235
The people I saved from demons
thanked me with tears in their eyes.

13:39.944 --> 13:42.905
That's a Hashira for you.
It was just one blow.

13:42.988 --> 13:46.283
The bad demon has been defeated,
so it's all right.

13:46.367 --> 13:47.451
Rest assured.

13:49.453 --> 13:51.539
Thank you very much!

13:51.622 --> 13:52.748
Thank you!

13:53.541 --> 13:54.416
DINER

13:54.500 --> 13:58.963
Iguro gave me a pair
of long-striped socks.

14:00.464 --> 14:01.465
Here.

14:03.217 --> 14:04.218
What is this?

14:04.301 --> 14:06.387
What do you mean by this, Iguro?

14:08.180 --> 14:09.265
For you.

14:10.099 --> 14:11.350
For me?

14:15.479 --> 14:18.816
I'm so glad!
I'll definitely treasure them.

14:19.817 --> 14:21.694
You don't need to.

14:23.028 --> 14:24.446
Why though?

14:25.072 --> 14:27.074
It's a shame.

14:28.242 --> 14:29.243
It's okay.

14:32.371 --> 14:35.457
If they happen to tear,
I'll give you new ones.

14:37.501 --> 14:38.502
Yeah!

14:42.006 --> 14:46.260
I wondered, like,
"Is it okay for a girl to be this strong?"

14:47.052 --> 14:51.348
I was afraid someone would say
that I wasn't a human.

14:51.432 --> 14:55.352
I was holding back my strength
because I was scared.

14:55.936 --> 14:57.354
But not anymore.

14:57.813 --> 15:00.441
She's the light of hope!

15:08.324 --> 15:09.491
Leave this to me.

15:09.575 --> 15:11.869
I'll protect you guys!

15:22.671 --> 15:24.715
I'll take care of him somehow!

15:30.054 --> 15:32.890
You go ahead and defeat the main body!

15:32.973 --> 15:34.350
Nezuko! Genya!

15:40.022 --> 15:41.815
I need to raise my heart rate

15:42.608 --> 15:44.693
and speed up my blood circulation.

15:45.361 --> 15:48.113
Faster and stronger!

15:48.197 --> 15:49.198
More and more!

15:54.078 --> 15:55.955
Those brats…

16:09.635 --> 16:11.095
I said I'll protect them.

16:11.845 --> 16:13.514
I won't let you go over there!

16:16.100 --> 16:19.853
Tanjiro, do you know where the tree ball
that wrapped the main body is?

16:19.937 --> 16:20.771
I know!

16:32.533 --> 16:33.784
Found him!

16:35.202 --> 16:36.578
This way!

16:36.662 --> 16:40.332
While Miss Kanroji is taking care
of that child demon,

16:40.416 --> 16:43.419
we have to behead the demon's main body
as soon as possible!

16:46.755 --> 16:50.718
This girl is moving even faster
than before.

16:51.176 --> 16:52.219
What did she do?

16:52.302 --> 16:53.137
What is she doing?

16:53.637 --> 16:55.222
What the hell is she…

16:57.099 --> 16:59.685
A mark? Has it always been there?

17:00.686 --> 17:04.273
It looks like a demon crest.

17:09.486 --> 17:11.905
I can't take this unpleasantness anymore.

17:11.989 --> 17:16.285
Because of this girl, I can't send
my lizards to kill those brats.

17:20.497 --> 17:22.207
How infuriating.

17:22.291 --> 17:25.252
But it won't last forever.

17:25.335 --> 17:28.130
At some point,
she's going to run out of strength

17:28.213 --> 17:30.299
because human beings have limits.

17:33.135 --> 17:36.096
If I said I won't let you,
it means I won't!

17:40.059 --> 17:41.101
There it is!

17:41.185 --> 17:42.478
Inside that tree!

17:44.271 --> 17:45.481
No doubt about it.

17:46.690 --> 17:49.151
The demon is wrapped in that tree.

17:49.234 --> 17:50.444
Let's catch it.

17:54.364 --> 17:55.783
We're almost there!

17:56.241 --> 17:58.327
Just stop! Will you!

18:06.627 --> 18:09.046
Don't get thrown off! Hang on!

18:09.129 --> 18:10.255
Hang in there!

18:10.339 --> 18:12.049
Before that…

18:12.132 --> 18:15.344
Before that snake-lizard-dragon
look-a-like comes this way!

18:16.053 --> 18:18.680
While Miss Kanroji is holding him off!

18:20.516 --> 18:23.435
I can't even swing my sword like this.

18:23.519 --> 18:26.522
Then this is the only way!

18:29.149 --> 18:32.319
He's chewing it!
Those are some strong teeth!

18:32.402 --> 18:34.780
Won't that upset your stomach, Genya?

18:34.863 --> 18:36.490
Will you be okay?

18:38.826 --> 18:44.373
By eating a demon, I gain the physical
constitution of a demon temporarily.

18:45.958 --> 18:48.252
If I eat a stronger demon,

18:48.335 --> 18:52.256
my regeneration ability
and my strength will increase.

19:01.807 --> 19:02.891
It's toppled.

19:03.851 --> 19:04.893
Now's my chance!

19:07.354 --> 19:09.064
The branch whips…

19:09.148 --> 19:11.358
Do not falter! Step forward!

19:20.534 --> 19:22.327
It's Nezuko's Blood Demon Art.

19:24.705 --> 19:26.331
The flames slowed it down.

19:27.040 --> 19:29.084
I can do it! I will cut it off!

19:32.171 --> 19:35.299
Hinokami Kagura: Flame Dance!

19:38.844 --> 19:40.637
That demon didn't get hit.

19:43.891 --> 19:46.685
It's not over until the main body
gets beheaded!

19:46.768 --> 19:49.188
Go for it, Tanjiro!

19:54.109 --> 19:55.277
He's gone.

19:55.360 --> 19:56.653
He fled again.

19:56.737 --> 19:58.906
Where? Where did he go?

19:58.989 --> 20:00.991
He shouldn't get that far yet.

20:09.041 --> 20:10.834
You bastard!

20:10.918 --> 20:13.170
Don't you dare run away!

20:13.253 --> 20:16.048
Don't run from your responsibility!

20:16.131 --> 20:19.509
You've committed too many sins
and evil deeds!

20:19.593 --> 20:22.930
I'll make sure
that you take responsibility for them all!

20:23.513 --> 20:25.307
I won't let you get away!

20:30.103 --> 20:35.943
You're responsible for what you've done.
No one else is.

20:36.026 --> 20:38.987
Understand? You two-faced liar!

20:40.405 --> 20:46.245
I have never told a lie since I was born.

20:46.328 --> 20:48.455
I am a good-natured weakling.

20:49.164 --> 20:53.961
I am so pitiful,
but no one feels sorry for me.

20:54.544 --> 20:57.881
I…

20:59.841 --> 21:02.094
I am not lying.

21:05.222 --> 21:07.349
Let's go! Nezuko, Genya!

21:13.730 --> 21:17.317
Damn it!

21:19.611 --> 21:24.783
Enough running, you shithead!

23:06.093 --> 23:07.094
DEMON SLAYER: SWORDSMITH VILLAGE ARC
NO. 10

23:07.677 --> 23:10.806
Miss Kanroji, thank you for protecting us.

23:10.889 --> 23:14.184
We will definitely defeat the Upper Rank.

23:16.228 --> 23:18.772
It's time for the Taishō era secret.

23:18.855 --> 23:23.985
It's said that after eight months
of eating 170 sakura mochis a day,

23:24.069 --> 23:27.114
Miss Kanroji's hair and eyes color
became like they are now.

23:27.197 --> 23:29.324
Is that true?

23:29.407 --> 23:31.827
If it's Miss Kanroji, it could be.

23:31.910 --> 23:36.832
To begin with, it's impossible to eat
that many sakura mochis every day…

23:36.915 --> 23:38.792
It's for you, Muichiro.

23:38.875 --> 23:40.252
Miss Kanroji!

23:40.335 --> 23:42.712
Let's eat together, Tanjiro!

23:42.796 --> 23:43.880
Thank you.

23:44.965 --> 23:46.424
Delicious!

23:46.508 --> 23:48.343
Next up on the last episode:

23:48.426 --> 23:51.805
"The Connected Bonds:
Daybreak And First Light."

23:51.888 --> 23:54.933
We won't let the demons get away
with what they want!

23:55.016 --> 23:55.976
True.

23:56.059 --> 23:57.519
We'll do our best!

23:57.602 --> 23:59.187
We're not gonna lose!

23:59.729 --> 24:01.022
TO BE CONTINUED
